    *) Bugfix: HTTP chunked responses might be encoded incorrectly on 32-bit
       platforms.

    *) Bugfix: infinite looping in HTTP parser.

    *) Bugfix: segmentation fault in router.


Changes with Unit 0.4                                            15 Jan 2018

